<rml>
<head>
    <title>Comet Runtime</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="runtime.rcss" />
</head>
<body data-model="ui">
    <div id="hud">
        <span id="fps">{{ fps_text }}</span>
        <button id="settings" data-event-click="command('open')" data-attrif-disabled="!menu_available"><img class="icon" src="icons/settings.png" />设置 / F1</button>
        <div id="notice">{{ error_text }}</div>
    </div>
    <div id="menu" style="display: none;">
        <div id="panel">
            <div class="eyebrow">COMET · 游戏设置</div>
            <h1>游戏设置</h1>
            <div id="display" data-if="display_available">
                <p><img class="icon" src="icons/display.png" />显示设置</p>
                <div class="display-dimensions">
                    <label for="display-width">宽</label>
                    <input id="display-width" type="text" maxlength="10" size="6" data-attr-value="display_width" data-event-change="command('display_width', ev.value)" data-attrif-disabled="waiting" />
                    <label for="display-height">高</label>
                    <input id="display-height" type="text" maxlength="10" size="6" data-attr-value="display_height" data-event-change="command('display_height', ev.value)" data-attrif-disabled="waiting" />
                </div>
                <button id="display-size" data-event-click="command('display_size')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">预设尺寸：{{ display_size }}</button>
                <button id="display-mode" data-event-click="command('display_mode')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || display_preview">{{ display_mode }}</button>
                <button id="display-vsync" data-event-click="command('display_vsync')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || display_preview">VSync 请求：{{ display_vsync }}</button>
                <div class="display-dimensions">
                    <label for="display-limit">帧率上限</label>
                    <input id="display-limit" type="text" maxlength="4" size="4" data-attr-value="display_limit" data-event-change="command('display_limit', ev.value)" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || display_preview" />
                    <button id="display-limit-preset" data-event-click="command('display_limit_preset')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || display_preview">{{ display_frame_rate }}</button>
                </div>
                <p class="hint">0 表示无上限；VSync、设备性能和系统调度可能使实际 FPS 更低。Play 不限制编辑器帧率。</p>
                <button id="display-output-mode" data-event-click="command('display_output_mode')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || display_preview">输出请求：{{ display_output_mode }}</button>
                <label for="display-hdr-headroom">HDR 高光范围：{{ display_hdr_headroom }}×</label>
                <input id="display-hdr-headroom" class="calibration" type="range" min="1" max="16" step="0.5" data-attr-value="display_hdr_headroom" data-event-change="command('display_hdr_headroom', ev.value)" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || display_hdr_disabled" />
                <label for="display-hdr-white">HDR 相对白色：{{ display_hdr_white }}%</label>
                <input id="display-hdr-white" class="calibration" type="range" min="50" max="200" step="5" data-attr-value="display_hdr_white" data-event-change="command('display_hdr_white', ev.value)" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || display_hdr_disabled" />
                <p class="hint">HDR 校准相对于系统合成器白色，作用于场景和 UI，不代表固定 nit 值。SDR 忽略校准值。</p>
                <p id="display-output-active" class="hint">{{ display_output_active }}</p>
                <p class="hint">{{ display_status }}</p>
                <p id="display-active-vsync" class="hint">{{ display_active_vsync }}</p>
                <button id="display-restore" data-event-click="command('display_restore')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">显示默认值</button>
                <button id="display-apply" data-event-click="command('display_apply')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">应用显示设置</button>
                <div id="display-confirmation" data-if="display_confirming">
                    <p>{{ display_confirmation_text }}</p>
                    <button id="display-confirm" class="primary" data-event-click="command('display_confirm')" data-attrif-disabled="display_waiting || display_output_pending">确认保留</button>
                    <button id="display-revert" data-event-click="command('display_revert')" data-attrif-disabled="display_waiting">还原 / Esc</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p id="display-error">{{ display_error }}</p>
            <div id="quality" data-if="quality_available">
                <p><img class="icon" src="icons/image.png" />画质设置</p>
                <p id="quality-preset" class="hint">草稿档位：{{ quality_preset }}</p>
                <button id="quality-performance" data-event-click="command('quality_preset', 'performance')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">性能</button>
                <button id="quality-balanced" data-event-click="command('quality_preset', 'balanced')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">均衡</button>
                <button id="quality-quality" data-event-click="command('quality_preset', 'quality')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">质量</button>
                <p class="hint">档位只修改草稿；MSAA 和各向异性按设备能力降低，仍可逐项调整。</p>
                <button id="quality-msaa" data-event-click="command('quality_msaa')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">MSAA：{{ quality_msaa }}</button>
                <button id="quality-anisotropy" data-event-click="command('quality_anisotropy')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">各向异性：{{ quality_anisotropy }}</button>
                <button id="quality-scale" data-event-click="command('quality_scale')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">渲染比例：{{ quality_scale }}</button>
                <p id="quality-active" class="hint">{{ quality_active }}</p>
                <p class="hint">{{ quality_status }}</p>
                <p id="quality-error">{{ quality_error }}</p>
                <button id="quality-restore" data-event-click="command('quality_restore')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">画质默认值</button>
                <button id="quality-apply" data-event-click="command('quality_apply')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">应用画质设置</button>
            </div>
            <div id="audio" data-if="audio_available">
                <p><img class="icon" src="icons/audio.png" />音量设置</p>
                <label for="audio-master">主音量：{{ audio_master }}%</label>
                <input id="audio-master" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" data-attr-value="audio_master" data-event-change="command('audio_master', ev.value)" data-attrif-disabled="waiting" />
                <label for="audio-effects">音效：{{ audio_effects }}%</label>
                <input id="audio-effects" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" data-attr-value="audio_effects" data-event-change="command('audio_effects', ev.value)" data-attrif-disabled="waiting" />
                <label for="audio-music">音乐：{{ audio_music }}%</label>
                <input id="audio-music" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" data-attr-value="audio_music" data-event-change="command('audio_music', ev.value)" data-attrif-disabled="waiting" />
                <p id="audio-active" class="hint">{{ audio_active }}</p>
                <p class="hint">应用后保存并影响正在播放的声音；取消丢弃未应用的草稿。</p>
                <p id="audio-error">{{ audio_error }}</p>
                <button id="audio-restore" data-event-click="command('audio_restore')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">音量默认值</button>
                <button id="audio-apply" data-event-click="command('audio_apply')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting">应用音量设置</button>
            </div>
            <p class="muted"><img class="icon" src="icons/input.png" />选择动作，录入新的按键或手柄按钮。取消不会保存草稿。</p>
            <div id="action-selector">
                <button id="previous" data-event-click="command('previous')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || !has_actions"><img class="icon" src="icons/previous.png" />上一个</button>
                <span id="action-name">{{ action_name }}</span>
                <button id="next" data-event-click="command('next')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || !has_actions">下一个<img class="icon trailing" src="icons/next.png" /></button>
            </div>
            <div id="bindings"></div>
            <p id="status">{{ status_text }}</p>
            <p id="error">{{ error_text }}</p>
            <div id="footer">
                <button id="restore" data-event-click="command('restore')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting"><img class="icon" src="icons/restore.png" />改键默认值</button>
                <button id="cancel" data-event-click="command('cancel')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting"><img class="icon" src="icons/close.png" />取消</button>
                <button id="apply" class="primary" data-event-click="command('apply')" data-attrif-disabled="waiting || !has_actions"><img class="icon" src="icons/confirm.png" />应用改键并返回</button>
            </div>
            <p class="hint">键鼠：Tab / 方向键选择，Enter 确认，Esc 返回 · 手柄：方向键选择，A 确认，B 返回</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
